         "Gold open access: final published version ko journal khud freely available karta hai, kabhi author ki di hui article processing charge se funded. Green open access: author paper ka aik version kisi repository mein jama karta hai (apni university ke, ya arXiv jaise subject server par), jahan har koi use free parh sakta hai.",
