         "No official UOS policy on AI research tools was found in the sources checked, so there is no published rule to quote. The safe position: using AI tools to FIND and ORGANISE research is normal practice, while submitting AI-generated text or unverified AI references as your own work violates academic integrity everywhere. Follow your department's and supervisor's instructions, and ask them when unsure.",
         "Checked sources mein AI research tools par koi official UOS policy nahi mili, is liye quote karne ke liye koi published rule nahi hai. Mehfooz mauqif: AI tools ko research DHUNDNE aur ORGANISE karne ke liye use karna aam practice hai, jabke AI-generated text ya unverified AI references ko apne kaam ke tor par submit karna har jagah academic integrity ki khilaf warzi hai. Apne department aur supervisor ki instructions follow karein, aur shak ho to un se poochein.",
