         "Add the place as its own search concept (Pakistan, or the city/province) combined with your topic, and also search without it then filter by reading — some relevant papers never name the place in title or abstract. Include local sources: Pakistani journals are recognised and listed through the HEC's journal system, and your library can point you to them.",
         "Jaga ko apna alag search concept bana kar add karein (Pakistan, ya sheher/sooba) apne topic ke sath mila kar, aur baghair is ke bhi search karke parh kar filter karein — kuch relevant papers title ya abstract mein jagah ka naam kabhi nahi lete. Local sources shamil karein: Pakistani journals HEC ke journal system se recognised aur listed hain, aur aap ki library un ki taraf rehnumai kar sakti hai.",
