         "Build a synonym set per concept that crosses fields — for example 'e-learning', 'online learning' and 'distance education' — by harvesting terms from the best papers you find and from database subject headings. Interdisciplinary topics fail mainly on vocabulary, so the fix is always more synonyms joined with OR, never a single 'perfect' keyword.",
