         "A technique that starts from one perfect 'pearl' paper: mine its title words, keywords and subject headings to build a better search; follow its references backwards and its citations forwards; and repeat with each new pearl you find. It is one of the most reliable ways to grow a search when you do not yet know a field's vocabulary.",
         "Aik technique jo aik perfect 'pearl' paper se start hoti hai: is ke title words, keywords aur subject headings mine karke behtar search banayein; is ki references backwards aur citations forwards follow karein; aur har naye pearl ke sath dobara karein jo aap ko mile. Jab aap field ki vocabulary abhi na jante hon to search barhane ke sab se reliable tareeqon mein se aik hai.",
