         "AND dono terms lazmi karta hai: 'online learning AND academic achievement' sirf woh results deta hai jin mein dono concepts hon, is liye AND search ko narrow karta hai. Zyada tar databases mukhtalif concepts ke darmiyan AND automatically lagati hain, lekin use wazeh likhna aap ki strategy ko saaf aur databases ke darmiyan portable rakhta hai.",
         SRC_RESOURCES, ST_GEN,
