         "Because authors choose different words for the same idea — if you search only 'teenagers', you miss every paper that wrote 'adolescents' or 'youth'. Find synonyms by reading seed papers and abstracts, checking database subject headings, and noting British/American and old/new terms. A concept with three or four good synonyms joined by OR is the single biggest upgrade to most student searches.",
         "Kyunke authors aik hi khayal ke liye mukhtalif alfaaz chunte hain — agar aap sirf 'teenagers' search karein to aap har woh paper miss karte hain jis ne 'adolescents' ya 'youth' likha. Synonyms seed papers aur abstracts parh kar, database subject headings check karke, aur British/American aur purane/naye terms note karke dhundein. OR se jure teen ya char ache synonyms wala concept zyada tar student searches ke liye sab se bari upgrade hai.",
