         "What are proximity operators like NEAR in searching?",
         "Searching mein NEAR jaise proximity operators kya hote hain?",
         "Operators that require words to appear close together — for example 'online NEAR/3 learning' finds the words within three words of each other, in some databases with NEAR or W/ (within). They sit between AND (anywhere in the record) and an exact phrase (side by side): precise like a phrase, flexible about small words in between. Syntax differs by database, so check its help.",
         "Operators jo alfaaz ka qareeb hona lazmi karte hain — masalan 'online NEAR/3 learning' alfaaz ko aik doosre ke teen alfaaz ke andar dhundta hai, kuch databases mein NEAR ya W/ (within) ke sath. Yeh AND (record mein kahin bhi) aur exact phrase (sath sath) ke darmiyan hote hain: phrase ki tarah precise, darmiyan ke chhote alfaaz ke baare mein flexible. Syntax database ke hisab se mukhtalif hota hai, is liye is ki help check karein.",
