         "Record ke aik hisay ke andar search karna, har jagah ke bajaye: title-only searching bohat precise hai (paper aap ke term ke BAARE mein hai), abstract searching balanced hai, aur author-field searching kisi shakhs ke kaam reliably dhundti hai. Advanced search screens in fields ko dropdowns ke tor par dikhati hain, aur kuch databases tags (TI=, AB=, AU=) use karti hain. Field searching woh tareeqa hai jis se aap noisy search ko controlled search mein badalte hain.",
