         "Database ki subject headings ki built-in dictionary — PubMed mein MeSH, education mein ERIC Thesaurus — jo har official term ko is ke broader, narrower aur related terms ke sath dikhati hai. Apne concept ko thesaurus mein dekhein, official heading chunein, aur aap ki search automatically har woh article jama karti hai jo is ke tehet indexed ho. Yeh synonym problem se nikalne ka reliable tareeqa hai.",
