         "MeSH headings aik tree banate hain: aik broad heading (jaise 'Education') ke neeche narrower headings hote hain. Heading search karna aam tor par sirf un articles ko cover karta hai jo bilkul usi term se tagged hon; use 'explode' karna is ke neeche ke tamam narrower headings ko bhi shamil karta hai, jaal ko wasee karke. Explode tab karein jab aap poori branch chahtay hon; baghair explode search karein jab sirf precise concept chahiye.",
