         "Yeh rahi aik misaal topic 'effect of online learning on university students' achievement' ke liye: (\"online learning\" OR e-learning OR \"distance education\") AND (university students OR undergraduates) AND (achievement OR performance OR grades). Pattern note karein: har parentheses ke andar OR se jure synonyms, AND se jure concepts, quotes mein phrases. Isi skeleton ko kisi bhi topic par apne concepts aur synonyms daal kar adapt karein.",
