         "Clarivate ke Journal Citation Reports ki aik yearly figure: taqreeban, woh average citations jo aik saal mein journal ke recent articles ko milein. Yeh JOURNAL ke citation traffic ko describe karta hai, kisi single article ki quality ko nahi, aur yeh sirf Web of Science ke journals ke liye maujood hai. Mukhtalif fields ke darmiyan impact factors ka muqabla misleading hai kyunke citation habits mein bohat farq hota hai.",
