         "MIT ki free website (ocw.mit.edu) jo hazaron MIT courses ke asal teaching materials publish karti hai — lecture notes, slides, assignments, exams aur aksar video lectures — har kisi ke seekhne ke liye, baghair enrolment aur baghair certificate. Yeh goldmine hai jab aap ke apne course ki textbook explanations samajh na ayen: wohi topic MIT ke tareeqay se parha hua dhundein.",
