         "Ji haan — students ke liye best-value courses mein se kuch bilkul yahi hain: Coursera, edX aur FutureLearn par research methods, statistics aur SPSS/R, academic writing, data analysis aur reference-tool courses, aksar mazboot universities se aur audit ke liye free. Unhein apni degree ke sath structured self-study samjhein, aur har skill ko sirf certificates jama karne ke bajaye apne asal coursework par practise karein.",
         "https://www.edx.org", ST_GEN,
