         "A UK-based MOOC platform, founded by the Open University, offering short courses and micro-credentials from universities and cultural institutions, with a noticeably social, discussion-based style. Many courses are free during their run with paid upgrades for extended access and certificates. Its health, teaching and humanities catalogues are particular strengths.",
