         "Pakistan ki pehli university jo mukammal tor par online education par mabni hai (vu.edu.pk), aik public-sector university jo lectures broadcast karti hai aur distance par degree programmes chalati hai, poore mulk mein campuses aur exam centres ke sath. Yeh DigiSkills training jaise qaumi projects ko bhi power karti hai. Yeh aik asal, HEC-recognised university hai — is ki degrees formal qualifications hain, MOOC certificates ke bar-aks.",
