         "A free-to-start web and mobile tool built specifically for the screening stage of systematic reviews: you import your search results, and it helps you include/exclude records quickly, work blinded alongside a second reviewer, and use simple AI assistance to sort likely-relevant records first. For student reviews it is the standard recommendation because the screening stage is where unaided spreadsheets collapse.",
         "Aik free-to-start web aur mobile tool jo khaas tor par systematic reviews ke screening stage ke liye bana hai: aap apne search results import karte hain, aur yeh aap ko records jaldi include/exclude karne, doosre reviewer ke sath blinded kaam karne, aur likely-relevant records pehle sort karne ke liye saada AI assistance use karne mein madad deta hai. Student reviews ke liye yeh standard recommendation hai kyunke screening stage woh jagah hai jahan baghair madad spreadsheets collapse hoti hain.",
         "https://www.rayyan.ai", ST_EXT,
